# Environment

# Vite exposes VITE_-prefixed variables to the browser bundle. Anything without the
# prefix stays on the server — which in a template with no server means: if you are
# about to write a secret here, there is no place to put it.
#
# Copy to `.env.local` and edit. `.env.local` is gitignored; `.env` is not.

VITE_APP_NAME=[APP NAME]

# Where the API lives, once you have one. The in-memory repository ignores it, so
# nothing breaks while it is absent.
VITE_API_URL=